# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) for local Workers runs: `opennextjs-cloudflare preview` and
# `E2E_SERVER=preview pnpm test:e2e`. Outside Production the Worker entry (worker.ts) refuses every
# request unless it has this password, and Playwright sends it. It is Staging's public password.
STAGING_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD=stagingpassword
